."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander looks at the girl before them. The sharp, thorn-like wariness they have been feeling dissipates in an instant, as though blown away by the wind. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"They recall the first time M4 took control of this body—how ST AR-15 recognized her right away."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This is what she must've felt."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I don't understand. I can't make sense of what you—and she—told me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What exactly was the bet between the two of you? Whether I can reach this place? Whether I can bring myself to kill you? Or whether I'll... give up?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What is the final stone that forms the line for you in this game of Gomoku?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That isn't important, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"What matters is whether you can accept the outcome."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I can't."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander's answer comes without the slightest hesitation."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I've missed you, M4. The rest of AR Team has missed you too. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But we didn't come here for personal feelings; we came for our mission. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even you... cannot stop me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia closes her eyes, a calm smile on her face."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Was that also within the possibilities you foresaw?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I didn't need to foresee it, Commander. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You are my Commander, and I am your M4A1."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I wouldn't be standing here in this moment if I didn't know you so well."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":7,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I know I cannot stop you. No matter what reason or excuse I give, I cannot break your resolve."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"However..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her expression turns somber in an instant."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Do you have the resolve to pay the price?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The price?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If killing William exacts a tremendous price... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even so, will you still go ahead without hesitation?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":4,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","raw":"同时置暗"}],"speaker":"Commander","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The Commander answers without the slightest pause."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I understand."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"sfx","value":"ClothingUp","raw":"SE1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Lunasia slowly walks closer. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"She rises onto her toes, cupping the Commander's face in her hands. Those eyes—not truly her own—lock directly onto theirs."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Within them, the Commander sees many things."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Scale":"1.5","Position":"0,-400"}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Lunasia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I will help you complete this mission. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But you must... do as I say."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Lunasia","expression":0,"side":"left","tags":{"Scale":"1.5","Position":"0,-400"}}],"ops":[{"type":"darken","